WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:07.229
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and since Supernatural
was just confirmed for season 10 I thought

00:00:07.229 --> 00:00:13.940
it would be fun to talk about some of the
people and things we’d like to see.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:18.939
Don’t forget next week will be more olympics
so I’ll probably just do another bonus supernatural

00:00:18.939 --> 00:00:19.939
video.

00:00:19.939 --> 00:00:27.630
If you’re finding me for the first time
be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:34.039
Before we get to season 10 let’s see where
we’re going to be at the end of this season.

00:00:34.039 --> 00:00:35.160
Everybody grab some pie.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.160
This is going to be fun.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.269
First, there’s the war for heaven AND hell.

00:00:38.269 --> 00:00:39.840
Let’s start up top.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:41.550
The real problem is re-opening heaven.

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:44.780
They still haven’t explained what metatron
did that’s keeping them locked out.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:47.250
So we don’t even fully understand what the
problem is.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.590
That’s basically castiel’s arc this season.

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:54.089
Solving that problem and ostensibly becoming
a wiser more sexed-up god.

00:00:54.089 --> 00:00:55.629
With a few extra city miles on him.

00:00:55.629 --> 00:00:58.600
I don’t know that i’d forgive the show
if they didn’t make him whole again eventually.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:02.910
So my first prediction for season 10 is that
Castiel will be made whole, he’ll get his

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:04.100
grace back.

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:07.910
Since the spell that closed heaven has something
to do with his grace, restoring castiel would

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:10.340
have to somehow restore heaven.

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:12.550
Jumping into the fire, Abaddon and Crowley.

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:13.960
Those two need to just get a room already.

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:17.000
It’s really just a question of which one
of them will rule hell.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.230
It’s like now that the angels are on earth,
the demons don’t even care.

00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:22.490
They just want their sweet sweet human soul
honey.

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:23.490
Shout out to cain.

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:27.090
The twist I think is coming this season is
that crowley will also be restored, because

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:29.920
who is he if not the other side of that castiel
coin.

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:33.460
My season 10 prediction for crowley is that
he’ll be the king of hell and working with

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:36.420
Sam, Dean and Castiel to defeat Abaddon.

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:40.930
Wait a minute hold the pie, isn’t dean supposed
to kill abaddon with the mark and the first

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:41.930
blade?

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:44.890
Short answer yes, but this season something
is going to stop him from being able to do

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:45.890
it.

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:47.380
Because they could never get rid of Alaina
Huffman.

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:48.760
She is far too precious.

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:51.880
Here’s where my season 10 predictions get
tied up together with Sam, Dean and Abaddon.

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:54.590
So I kind of have to talk about all of them
at the same time.

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:58.370
If you haven’t seen it, I predicted that
because Sam’s possession tattoo was burned

00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:04.920
off, Abaddon will end up possessing him preventing
dean from killing samaddon.

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:09.030
Remember that’s why Cain wasn’t able to
kill abaddon.

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:13.600
So my season 10 prediction is that we’ll
start off with Sam still possessed at the

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:14.600
beginning of the season.

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:17.750
The alternative is that Dean is finally able
to get over himself and let Sam die.

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:22.600
And if Supernatural has taught us anything,
it’s that Dean will always be Dean.

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:23.680
He’s not going to change.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.130
At least not permanently.

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:28.530
My Season 10 prediction for Dean is that he’ll
still be carrying around the mark of cain

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:30.500
trying to restore his brother.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:34.690
At this point there aren’t a lot of places
the story could go without creating a reason

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:36.240
to bring God back into the equation.

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:39.060
And the whole idea of the show is that God
left.

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:42.580
So my other big season 10 prediction is that
we still won’t see god.

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:47.300
There’s no reason to think the show won’t
get a season 11, but if they did want to end

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:48.300
the show completely.

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:51.819
there’s really only a couple ways for them
to do it without getting too silly.

00:02:51.819 --> 00:02:56.600
Here they are from least likely to most likely.

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:59.450
Number 5 - They both die and go to heaven.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:00.459
Finally at peace.

00:03:00.459 --> 00:03:03.320
Possible, but highly improbable.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:07.940
Number 4 - Dean sacrifices himself and Sam
is left to live out the rest of his life as

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:08.940
a hunter.

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:10.930
Remember, there’s always going to be evil
in the world.

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:13.340
So there will always need to be hunters.

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:15.790
This is a slightly more likely outcome.

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:21.650
Number 3 - Their dad returns in a deus ex
machina and sacrifices himself again to try

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:25.330
and make amends for being a terrible dad and
giving them such shitty lives.

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:28.800
Also unlikely, but a final cameo from dad
would be a nice bookend to the series.

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:31.880
And they’d both be alive at the end in this
scenario.

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:36.790
Number 2 - Dean finally grows up inside and
let’s Sam die for real, then tries to live

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:40.460
out the rest of his life trying to figure
out how to stop being a hunter and settle

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:41.460
down.

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:43.890
Slightly more likely, but still not the best
option.

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:48.740
and finally, my number one potential ending
to the series.- Neither of them dies and things

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:51.120
end with them giving the business to another
demon.

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:56.520
This is the ending that would give fans the
story a place to continue like nothing had

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:58.630
happened even if the tv show ends.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:01.950
So they just keep going on adventures in the
comics and the books, getting themselves into

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:05.069
all kinds of trouble with the help of castiel
and crowley.

00:04:05.069 --> 00:04:10.240
Let me know what you’re biggest prediction
for supernatural season 10 is and how you

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:12.260
think they’ll end the series.

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:15.010
Next week I’ll be doing my top 5 characters
to bring back in season 10.

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:16.269
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:04:16.269 --> 00:04:19.689
And new Game of Thrones trailer coming sunday.

00:04:19.689 --> 00:04:24.910
I’ll be doing a full breakdown.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:26.800
So get excited.

